## Stack

Expo app → hooks → services → API client. Backend handlers → services → repositories + adapters (Gemini, billing, storage).

- TanStack Query for server data. **No new global state library** until a ticket needs it and user approves.
- Expo Router; onboarding/auth stack separate from tabs.
- No secrets in the app.

## Scan pipeline (server)

Auth → entitlement/quota → validate image → SkinAnalyzer (Gemini, Zod) → calculateIndex → transactional save + usage → photo retention → return (idempotent).

## DB

One table per entity; JSONB for scan scores; RLS on all user data; atomic quota upsert; full user deletion path. Migrations only — never edit old ones.

## Repo layout

`apps/mobile`, `packages/domain`, `backend/`, `docs/`.

